@model NodeState
@*
    The colours match the LEDs on the node: blue SAFE, green INIT, yellow ARMED,
    red FIRE. Deliberate - somebody looking at the board and somebody looking at
    this page should be describing what they see in the same words.
*@
<span class="state state-@Model.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()">@Model.ToString().ToUpperInvariant()</span>
